+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents, which is simpler than RFC 6902 JSON Patch. The toolkit has no way to apply them.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386 and returning the merged document as a new value.
+- Same conventions as `applyPatch`: inputs are never mutated and the result shares no object or array with them.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New module `src/merge-patch.ts` plus tests, and a new export in `src/index.ts`. No dependency or breaking change.
